# do not delete me
#
# Git tracks files, not directories, so this directory would vanish from
# the next clone without a file in it. This is that file. It ignores
# nothing on purpose — see `keepMarker` in schemas/cat-harness.ts.
#
# uploads/  (THE REPOSITORY'S OWN)
# Declared by `harness.json` at the repo ROOT, because this checkout acts as
# an initialized instance and an initialized instance's ingestion queue sits
# at its own root. `cat-harness/uploads/` is a DIFFERENT queue belonging to
# the harness layer — same id, different instance, not one directory declared
# twice. Files dropped at the repository root land here; the harness layer's
# own sources stay with the harness.
